WEBVTT

00:00:03.245 --> 00:00:06.415
Where are we? A graveyard.

00:00:06.832 --> 00:00:09.418
This is no graveyard.

00:00:16.925 --> 00:00:19.886
It's a chessboard.

00:00:31.857 --> 00:00:33.775
There's the door.

00:00:45.787 --> 00:00:47.289
Now what do we do?

00:00:47.706 --> 00:00:51.793
It's obvious, isn't it? We've got
to play our way across the room.

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:56.173
Harry, you take
the empty bishop's square.

00:00:56.465 --> 00:01:00.719
Hermione, you'll be
the queen-side castle.

00:01:00.969 --> 00:01:04.973
As for me, I'll be a knight.

00:01:12.189 --> 00:01:13.899
What happens now?

00:01:14.691 --> 00:01:17.694
Well, white moves first.

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:22.783
We play.

00:01:33.335 --> 00:01:38.423
Ron, you don't suppose
this is going to be like...

00:01:38.673 --> 00:01:42.219
Real wizard's chess, do you?

00:01:42.594 --> 00:01:45.514
You there, d5.

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:01.738
Yes, Hermione.

00:02:01.947 --> 00:02:07.035
I think this is gonna be
exactly like wizard's chess.

00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:15.460
Castle to e4!

00:02:19.047 --> 00:02:21.383
Pawn to c3!

00:03:06.011 --> 00:03:10.015
- Wait a minute.
- Ron: You understand right, Harry.

00:03:10.265 --> 00:03:14.936
Once I make my move,
the queen will take me.

00:03:15.604 --> 00:03:17.939
Then you're free to check the king.

00:03:18.106 --> 00:03:20.859
- No. Ron, no!
- What is it?

00:03:21.443 --> 00:03:26.114
- He's going to sacrifice himself.
- No, there must be another way!

00:03:26.364 --> 00:03:30.118
Do you wanna stop Snape
from getting that stone or not?

00:03:30.327 --> 00:03:33.914
Harry, it's you that has to go on.
I know it.

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:37.125
Not me. Not Hermione. You.

00:03:47.427 --> 00:03:50.347
Knight to h3.

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:13.286
Check.

00:04:44.442 --> 00:04:50.198
No, don't move!
Don't forget, we're still playing.

00:05:05.297 --> 00:05:06.548
Checkmate.

00:05:26.526 --> 00:05:29.029
Take care of Ron.
Then go to the owlery.

00:05:29.237 --> 00:05:33.074
Send a message to Dumbledore.
Ron's right.

00:05:33.325 --> 00:05:35.201
I have to go on.

00:05:35.702 --> 00:05:41.583
You'll be okay, Harry.
You're a great wizard. You really are.

00:05:41.833 --> 00:05:44.336
Not as good as you.

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:50.008
Me? Books and cleverness.
There are more important things.

